line-height:1.17;&quot;&gt;credit / cancel: 처리량 조절&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=17;fontColor=#000000;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="2092" y="632" width="390" height="19.89" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n299" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;C1 대화 / R2: u2 “잠깐, 표부터 설명해줘” / T1 메일 업무·Q1 수신자 질문 / P1 보고서 재생·P2 표 설명 후보&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=18;fontColor=#000000;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1340" y="1118" width="1160" height="23.4" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n300" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;Publication Join: 입력 해소·admission·source.rev·과거 receipt / 확인 질문 별도 admission / 자기 receipt 후행&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=18;fontColor=#000000;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1340" y="1150" width="1160" height="23.4" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n301" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;권한: owner ↔ Policy Manager / 내구 확정: owner → State Store / 같은 Request·Task·질문·publication 원본&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=17;fontColor=#000000;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1340" y="1182" width="1160" height="22.1" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n302" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;Voice Runtime에는 Interaction Manager의 음성 입출력·즉시 중단 기능과 Model Access client가 배치된다.&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=18;fontColor=#000000;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1340" y="1212" width="1160" height="23.4" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n303" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;공통: 동시 실행 수가 제한된 비동기 executor. Blocking 작업은 제한된 worker pool. 모델은 Model Access의 별도 scheduler.&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=17;fontColor=#000000;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1340" y="1242" width="1160" height="22.1" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n304" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;이벤트 채널·구독·단계별 수용량 조절·취소 전달은 실행 라이브러리가 지원한다. credit/cancel은 Task 취소가 아니다.&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=17;fontColor=#000000;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1340" y="1272" width="1160" height="22.1" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n305" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;capture·ASR·즉시 stop은 이해 완료와 무관 / hold는 Task 취소가 아님 / 공유 Omni 가중치 한 벌, 역할별 KV&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=17;fontColor=#000000;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1340" y="1302" width="1160" height="22.1" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n306" parent="1" vertex="1" value="" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;rounded=0;fillColor=white;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1.0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="184" y="1368" width="150" height="32" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n307" parent="n306" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.17;&quot;&gt;Component&lt;/div&gt;" style="